{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>錢嘉樂日前迎來61歲生日，太太湯盈盈攜13歲長女錢凱晴及11歲幼女錢凱琪一同為他慶祝。現場有民眾捕捉到這溫馨一刻，並上載至社交平台與網民分享，一家四口的有愛互動隨即成為焦點。</span></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b3b76e58-ca60-45e0-b409-5d340c10b840.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026wynwhX6UPX1786503562.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b3b76e58-ca60-45e0-b409-5d340c10b840.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"00fc2c86-722d-4fbb-abc5-6d83c293710c.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026k6o9bMcp6D1786503562.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"00fc2c86-722d-4fbb-abc5-6d83c293710c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_97767db38a5b0889-827\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>在吹蠟燭環節中，大女展現出成熟懂事的一面，主動讓妹妹先吹蠟燭，直到妹妹未能吹熄剩餘的燭光時才適時出手幫忙，被眼尖的網民大讚體貼且有禮貌。此外，不少網民也紛紛分享私下偶遇錢嘉樂一家的經歷，大讚兩姊妹平時出街安靜又有規矩，而湯盈盈對路人亦親切有禮，一致盛讚夫婦二人身教有方。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T05:05:39.779944+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":223,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}